        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you search for anomalies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in different situations, use the chapter’s own mechanic to align pieces together, discover hidden connections, uncover the truth behind the anomalies, and piece the fragmented story back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out—at the end of each chapter, you have a choice that will lead to a different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game's Current State;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 2 chapters available:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1 – Behind Closed Doors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tool in this chapter is a camera. You need to find the anomaly behind the red room and take a picture of it. Use the green room for comparison. After capturing the anomaly, return to the starting zone. Repeat this process until you have taken all the required pictures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 2 – Elevator Sequence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first time you enter the floor, everything appears normal. Memorize the layout and details. After your first choice, anomalies may appear. If you notice an anomaly, choose the left elevator. If everything seems normal, choose the right elevator. There is a progress counter, once it reaches 10, you'll reach the finale. But be careful: one mistake will reset your progress to zero.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Note:</strong> the game isn't necessarily easy, there are plenty of tough to find anomalies, so don't expect instant success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode available;</strong> you don’t have to do this alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In case of technical issues:</strong><br>-Update GPU driver<br>-Lower the Graphics settings/Screen resolution<br>-Update Windows OS<br>-Contact us with your problem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is only available in English.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you search for anomalies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stuck in different situations, use the chapter’s own mechanic to align pieces together, discover hidden connections, uncover the truth behind the anomalies, and piece the fragmented story back together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out—at the end of each chapter, you have a choice that will lead to a different ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game's Current State;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are currently 2 chapters available:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 1 – Behind Closed Doors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your tool in this chapter is a camera. You need to find the anomaly behind the red room and take a picture of it. Use the green room for comparison. After capturing the anomaly, return to the starting zone. Repeat this process until you have taken all the required pictures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter 2 – Elevator Sequence</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first time you enter the floor, everything appears normal. Memorize the layout and details. After your first choice, anomalies may appear. If you notice an anomaly, choose the left elevator. If everything seems normal, choose the right elevator. There is a progress counter, once it reaches 10, you'll reach the finale. But be careful: one mistake will reset your progress to zero.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Note:</strong> the game isn't necessarily easy, there are plenty of tough to find anomalies, so don't expect instant success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op mode available;</strong> you don’t have to do this alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In case of technical issues:</strong><br>-Update GPU driver<br>-Lower the Graphics settings/Screen resolution<br>-Update Windows OS<br>-Contact us with your problem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game is only available in English.</p>",
        "short_description": "Search for anomalies! Use each chapter’s mechanic to solve short stories, uncover the truth, and choose your ending. Co-op mode lets you play together.",
